    "name": "CoffeeNChill Part 3",
    "description": "Part 3 gateway tests. Folder 0 creates the demo accounts and saves tokens, folder 1 tests registration, login, profile and users, folder 5 is the role matrix (the same protected request as no token, Customer, Staff and Admin). Menu, documents, orders and deployment folders are added from the individual member collections.",
